38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-fe26964b1e8e2d41END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-7575aa23404fa7f3END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_GEN_World_GuideRisenRoad</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_GEN_World_GuideRisenRoad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_GEN_World_GuideRisenRoad\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">2aed64cd-0eb0-4351-9259-183d3f345910</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:2aed64cd-0eb0-4351-9259-183d3f345910\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:2aed64cd-0eb0-4351-9259-183d3f345910\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nansi_Gretta\" title=\"Nansi Gretta\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/25px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/38px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/50px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nansi Gretta\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/25px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nansi_Gretta\" title=\"Nansi Gretta\">Nansi Gretta</a></li>\n<li>In the <a href=\"/wiki/Secluded_Chamber\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Secluded Chamber\">Secluded Chamber</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-58&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;69</span></li>\n<li>At the <a href=\"/wiki/Risen_Road\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Risen Road\">Risen Road</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;111&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;560</span></li>\n<li>In a the southeastern bookcase inside the atrium of the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Healing\" title=\"House of Healing\">House of Healing</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-182&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;36</span></li>\n<li>On the first floor of <a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Moonrise Towers</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[The stained, well-thumbed pages filled with travelling advice that seems to be decades out of date]\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>... those who seek to journey to the coast from the interior regions lying to the east will typically seek out the Risen Road. Running parallel to the River <a href=\"/wiki/Chionthar\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Chionthar\">Chionthar</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/Risen_Road\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Risen Road\">Risen Road</a> provides an overland route all the way from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Elturel\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Elturel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Elturel\">Elturel</a></span> to <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"Baldur's Gate\">Baldur's Gate</a>, and has proven tempting to travellers seeking an alternate to the river barges that sail the Chionthar.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>A portion of the road approximately halfway between Elturel and Baldur's Gate has in recent years developed into an enclave for <a href=\"/wiki/Sel%C3%BBne\" title=\"Selûne\">Selûne</a> worship, with a temple of not insignificant splendour lying near the road. Indeed an entire village, <a href=\"/wiki/Blighted_Village\" title=\"Blighted Village\">Moonhaven</a>, has developed alongside the temple, and can provide food and shelter to weary travellers.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Farther east lies the citadel of <a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Moonrise Towers</a>, where a toll is required for onward passage of goods and folk alike. Some are tempted to go off-road in order to avoid the toll, however bandits and other dangers may cause them to pay a much steeper price...\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714205636\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.053 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.055 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1812/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 35617/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 12787/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 937301/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   43.172      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   43.172      1 -total\n 51.60%   22.275      8 Template:Icon_text\n 45.13%   19.485     19 Template:Trim\n 22.49%    9.708      2 Template:Uid\n 14.92%    6.442      3 Template:Icon_link\n 14.59%    6.298      1 Template:Main_only\n 12.76%    5.508      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.08%    4.353      8 Template:Ifempty\n  9.02%    3.892      1 Template:Books\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12532-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714205636 and revision id 319231. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}